t\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+(2) &=3 \\\\ -{x}_{1} &=1 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=6 \\\\ -(-1)+2(2) &=6 \\\\ 5 &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution." 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672930 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672916 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672930 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672930 1071 "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 21\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672930 1072 #uuid "7ab95026-35d0-5991-bf3d-193491fa5be0" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672930 1074 "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 21\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 21\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 21\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-9 \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-7 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=21\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the first and the second equations we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{2} &=-16 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=8$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-9 \\\\ {x}_{1}-(8) &=-9 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=8$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=21 \\\\ 2(-1)+3(8) &=21 \\\\ 22 &=21\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution." 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672931 1080 "13" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672931 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672931 1083 #uuid "7c8d7203-c465-54cd-8a86-a85b87824924" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672932 1080 "No solution" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672932 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672932 1083 #uuid "87965bcd-038d-55e8-b8b1-063cfb5cbc32" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672933 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672912 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672933 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672933 1071 "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672933 1072 #uuid "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672933 1074 "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-8{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x