\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=-5 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-15 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=-17\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the second and the third equations we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8{x}_{1} &=-32 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{1}=-4$ into the third equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=-17 \\\\ 4(-4)+{x}_{2} &=-17 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-4$ and ${x}_{2}=-1$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=-5 \\\\ (-4)+2(-1) &=-5 \\\\ -6 &=-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution." 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1075 #edb/ref 17592186672913 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1075 #edb/ref 17592186672917 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1075 #edb/ref 17592186672924 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1075 #edb/ref 17592186672938 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1075 #edb/ref 17592186672944 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1077 "selection" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1078 #edb/ref 17592186672924 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672943 1079 #uuid "e365304b-ea02-5e2a-bbbe-51ee320976e3" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672944 1080 "7" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672944 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672944 1083 #uuid "e48a5a27-1b8e-5fa2-8837-2bbd1003de2a" 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672945 1075 #edb/ref 17592186672921 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [17592186672945 1075 #edb/ref 17592186672923 13194139538713 17592186045443 true] [1759218667294